flowchart TD
    A[Detect corruption, loss or outage] --> B[Declare incident and stop unsafe writers/external effects]
    B --> C[Identify time, scope, releases and provider effects]
    C --> D[Select backup/PITR and restore to isolated environment]
    D --> E[Verify schema, roles, RLS, constraints, counts and keys]
    E --> F[Replay deletion, revocation and legal-hold state]
    F --> G[Reconcile object manifest and checksums]
    G --> H[Rebuild search, cache, reports and sync projections]
    H --> I[Inspect outbox/inbox and reconcile payment/message unknowns]
    I --> J[Run canary tenant isolation and booking tests]
    J --> K{Recovery verified?}
    K -->|No| L[Keep isolated, correct or choose another recovery point]
    L --> D
    K -->|Yes| M[Stage read-only then essential writes and provider effects]
    M --> N[Monitor, communicate and complete post-incident actions]
